Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.57,0:01:11.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:11.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm bored
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.07,0:01:14.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有点意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.07,0:01:14.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.05,0:01:15.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:15.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.05,0:01:19.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去老章鱼哥的棚屋里找事做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.05,0:01:17.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go look for something to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:19.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in old man Squidward's shed
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.39,0:01:21.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老章鱼哥的棚屋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.39,0:01:21.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Old man Squidward's shed?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.69,0:01:24.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:24.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yyyuuup
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.77,0:01:32.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:32.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.88,0:01:36.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:36.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.32,0:01:38.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:38.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.76,0:01:52.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老章鱼哥来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:52.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's old man Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hide
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.32,0:02:02.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的铲子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:02.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's my trowel?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.18,0:02:03.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:03.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.47,0:02:06.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是铲子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:06.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is this a trowel?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.22,0:02:11.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.22,0:02:11.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here it is
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.56,0:02:16.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别伤害我们  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:16.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt us, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.72,0:02:17.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们好无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:17.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're bored
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.55,0:02:18.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们只是想玩你的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:18.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just want to play with your
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.06,0:02:21.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这随便什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:21.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatever this thing is
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.30,0:02:25.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个白痴大概率会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:25.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You morons would probably--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.10,0:02:28.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们是想玩我的割草机吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.10,0:02:28.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to play with my lawn mower?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.75,0:02:31.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:31.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你让我们修剪你家草坪  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting us mow your lawn, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.63,0:02:39.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我用来做蟹黄堡的手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:39.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My Patty-flipping hand
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请自便
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Knock yourselves out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(696,540)}墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:18.84,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,256)}戴维琼斯
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  戴维
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Davy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.13,0:03:25.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我四百年来第一次跟陌生人约会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:25.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got my first blind date in 400 years
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得打扮得体面点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I've got to look good
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有点破了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a little torn
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.31,0:03:31.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然了  这可是我被埋葬时穿的衬衣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:31.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Course, it was the shirt I was buried in
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.67,0:03:33.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回忆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:33.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Memories
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.00,0:03:43.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  那件有点臭了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:43.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, that one's a bit ripe
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.75,0:03:45.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有污渍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:45.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stained
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.03,0:03:46.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:46.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Naw
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.78,0:03:48.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太痒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:48.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too itchy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.70,0:03:49.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:49.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There she is
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.98,0:03:52.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一直留着这件漂亮货等特殊场合穿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:52.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been savin' this beauty for a special occasion
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.32,0:03:57.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真好看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:57.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lookin' good
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.51,0:04:27.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁胆敢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:27.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who dares--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.39,0:04:30.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:30.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.45,0:04:32.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打扰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:32.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Disturb--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.59,0:04:34.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,飞天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:34.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The flyin'--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.08,0:04:37.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:37.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dutchman?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My beard
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.06,0:04:57.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁胆敢打扰飞天魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:57.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who dares disturb the flyin' Dutchman?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.84,0:04:59.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你才不是飞天魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:04:59.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not the Flying Dutchman
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.94,0:05:02.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  飞天魔鬼长胡子的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:02.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the Flying Dutchman has a beard
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.82,0:05:05.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我之所以不像飞天魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:05.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't look like the Flying Dutchman
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.09,0:05:08.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是因为我胡子被你们两个白痴剃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:08.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because you morons cut off my beard
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样显得你年轻了一千岁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Makes you look a thousand years younger
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不想显年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't want to look younger
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.67,0:05:14.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我讨厌青春
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:14.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate youth
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.02,0:05:16.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很有可能会再长青春痘的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:16.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll probably get pimples again
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.62,0:05:18.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你胡子会长回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:18.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your beard will just grow back
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.67,0:05:21.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们根本就不懂我的胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:21.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know nothing of my facial hair
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.00,0:05:24.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我胡子得一千年才能再长回去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:24.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It'll take a thousand years for my beard to grow back
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.59,0:05:28.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  我们不懂当鬼是什么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:28.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we don't know what it's like to be ghosts
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.14,0:05:30.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你们也许是时候该学学看了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:30.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe it's time you learned
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.84,0:05:33.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我胡子长回来之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:33.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Until my beard grows back
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.70,0:05:37.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要把你们两个傻子变成鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:37.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn you two fools into ghosts
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.02,0:05:38.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好被
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:38.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.45,0:05:40.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鬼魂化吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:40.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ghostified
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.30,0:05:41.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鬼魂化吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:41.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ghostified?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.77,0:05:44.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没这种词吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:44.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's not even a real word
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.82,0:05:53.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  你们玩得太乐了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:53.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're having too much fun
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.80,0:06:00.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是美人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:00.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're mermaids
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.68,0:06:03.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们是鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.68,0:06:03.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're ghosts
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're ghosts
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.64,0:06:11.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,事情的发展跟我想象的不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:11.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This isn't really working out the way I imagined
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.01,0:06:26.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:26.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squiiiidwarrrrrd
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.60,0:06:29.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:29.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's spongeboooob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.90,0:06:32.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:32.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And patriiiick
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.80,0:06:36.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:36.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're ghooooosts
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.60,0:06:47.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要缠上你一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:47.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're going to haunt you foreveeeeer
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.65,0:06:54.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真扫兴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:54.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that killed the mood
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就不该把我割草机借给他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew I shouldn't have lent them my lawn mower
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当鬼可太容易累了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Being a ghost can sure tire you out
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.70,0:07:08.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  鬼兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:08.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, ghost buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.20,0:07:14.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:14.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's odd
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.42,0:07:15.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到底该怎么进去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.42,0:07:15.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,However shall I get in?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.10,0:07:19.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还挺方便
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:19.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's handy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.47,0:07:21.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:21.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am beat
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.21,0:07:24.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用走楼梯了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:24.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't need to take the stairs
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.88,0:07:52.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:52.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我昨晚没睡好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't sleep so good last night
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.49,0:07:56.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我完全没睡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:56.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't sleep at all
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.10,0:07:58.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都能看透我的眼皮了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:58.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could see through my eyelids
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.85,0:08:00.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的眼皮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:00.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My eyelids
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上班要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm late for work
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.05,0:08:03.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的眼皮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:03.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My eyelids
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:06.38,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(340,398)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.55,0:08:09.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:09.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm here
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.50,0:08:13.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有美人鱼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:13.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mermaid
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.99,0:08:15.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.99,0:08:15.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, you're late
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.39,0:08:16.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么成荧光绿的了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:16.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you bright green?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你腿又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to your legs?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.37,0:08:20.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他是个鬼  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:20.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a ghost, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.91,0:08:21.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:21.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A ghost, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.82,0:08:23.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还能做蟹黄堡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:23.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you still cook krabby patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.31,0:08:24.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能的  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:24.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can do, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就去厨房顾好你的岗位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then get your captain's quarters in the kitchen
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.61,0:08:28.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  活生生的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:28.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, oh, living employer
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.41,0:09:16.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做不了蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:16.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't cook krabby patties
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.91,0:09:19.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再也不想当鬼了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:19.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be a ghost anymore, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.78,0:09:20.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:20.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't either
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.15,0:09:23.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我什么都吃不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:23.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't eat anything
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.45,0:09:25.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,食物直接就穿透我了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:25.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Food just goes right through me
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.21,0:09:31.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许那个无胡怪男可以把我们变回去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:31.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe the weird hairless man will change us back
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.65,0:09:34.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  去看飞天魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:34.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go see the Flying Dutchman
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.75,0:09:40.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起码我气质还在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:40.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,At least I still have my personality
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.80,0:09:41.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把我们变回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:41.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Change us back
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.68,0:09:42.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把我们变回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:42.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Change us back
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们不喜欢当鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't like being ghosts
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.16,0:09:45.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我讨厌当鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:45.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate being a ghost
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.49,0:09:46.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  飞天魔鬼先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:46.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Dutchman
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.80,0:09:47.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:47.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we can't take it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.21,0:09:50.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不停悲叹  不停呻吟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:50.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Constantly moaning and groaning
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,世界看不见我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Invisible to the world
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.65,0:09:54.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,生活没有灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:54.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Living without a soul
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.74,0:09:55.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痛苦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:55.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's miserable
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.68,0:09:58.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么会有人都这样了还能活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.68,0:09:58.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How could anyone live like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.10,0:10:06.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你们感受到了我的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:06.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess you feel my pain
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这就解除你们身上的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll lift the curse from you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.89,0:10:21.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们没变回去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:21.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're still ghosts
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.24,0:10:25.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诅咒得等我胡子长回来了才会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:25.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The curse will wear off when my beard grows back
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.65,0:10:29.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我们现在就想恢复正常
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:29.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we want to be normal now
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也现在就想约会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I want to be on my date now
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.92,0:10:33.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是约会也被你们两个白痴搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:33.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you knuckleheads loused that up too
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.66,0:10:38.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们没变回去是因为你没法去约会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:38.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're still ghosts because you can't go on your date?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.68,0:10:41.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没法去约会是因为你很丑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:41.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you can't go on your date because you're ugly?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.74,0:10:45.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来打扮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.74,0:10:45.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Makeover
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:59.17,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,522)}水母酱
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.43,0:11:18.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:18.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, fellas
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.52,0:11:19.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱这新胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:19.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love the new beard
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要去约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off on my date
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.50,0:11:23.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别熬夜等我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:23.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't wait up
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.97,0:11:27.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没听明白
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:27.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't get it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.13,0:11:29.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,几个月后
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.27,0:11:33.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,几个月就这么过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:33.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, here we are several months later
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.09,0:11:34.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道飞天魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:34.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wonder how the Dutchman
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.02,0:11:35.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,和他的新女友过得咋样了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:35.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and his new girlfriend are doing
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.50,0:11:36.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:36.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't do it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.13,0:11:39.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她想嫁给我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:39.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She wants to marry me
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不适合结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I ain't the marryin' type
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.19,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,竖笛幻境
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:54.65,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:54.65,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:57.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:57.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(385.575,418)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:57.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(505.742,672)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:59.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:59.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:03.70,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1099,496)}停
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.25,0:12:09.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:09.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a day
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.70,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447.408,461.678)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.26,0:12:18.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:18.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, krusty krab
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.69,0:12:21.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:21.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.62,0:12:22.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没看到你站那
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:22.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Didn't see you there
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not a problem, Spongebob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一点事都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not a problem at all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:29.35,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(918.552,180.012)}今日特餐
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.13,0:12:28.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,特餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:28.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Specials?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.44,0:12:29.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本没特餐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:29.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't have specials
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.85,0:12:40.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.85,0:12:40.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.20,0:12:42.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:42.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the krusty krab
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.35,0:12:45.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要来份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.35,0:12:45.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I'll have a krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.06,0:12:53.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份蟹黄堡马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:53.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One krabby Patty comin' up
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.08,0:12:55.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥先生  你今早挺高兴的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:55.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Squidward, you're in a chipper mood this mornin'
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.48,0:12:59.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是不是邮购的高级装饰香皂收到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you get an order
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:59.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of fancy decorative soaps in the mail or somethin'?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.28,0:13:00.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比那强
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:00.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Even better
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.18,0:13:04.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我今天下班后马上就有场竖笛演奏会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:02.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have a clarinet recital
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:04.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,immediately after work today
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.09,0:13:06.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啥都糟蹋不了我一整天的好心情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:06.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so ain't nothing gonna ruin my day
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.34,0:13:10.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常对不起  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:10.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Terribly sorry, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.85,0:13:11.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:11.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No need
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.05,0:13:12.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看见没
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.05,0:13:12.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.76,0:13:14.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滴滴不沾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.76,0:13:14.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not a drop
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.92,0:13:23.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再也忍不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:23.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都说了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.60,0:13:26.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有早间特餐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:26.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no early bird special
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.42,0:13:28.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别给我打电话了  老妈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:28.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, stop callin' me here, mother
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.13,0:13:30.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这简直不可接受
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.13,0:13:30.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is unacceptable
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.65,0:13:31.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.65,0:13:31.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.11,0:13:31.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:31.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.98,0:13:33.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可算恢复原状了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.98,0:13:33.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice to have you back, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忍都忍不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is an outrage
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.81,0:13:38.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再也不容许我的私人物品
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:38.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will no longer tolerate my personal items
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.50,0:13:41.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被爬进这餐厅的贱民玷污
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:40.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,being soiled by the rabble
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:41.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that crawls into this restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.86,0:13:45.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要求能有个地方来安置我东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:45.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I demand a place to put my stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.95,0:13:46.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:46.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就放玉米片奶酪酱那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I suppose you could put it with the nacho cheese
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.05,0:13:50.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那东西几年都没人碰过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:50.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one's gone near that in years
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.80,0:13:52.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看过这本没  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:52.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You ever read this, krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.71,0:13:55.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村劳动法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:55.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bikini bottom labor regulations?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gross
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.66,0:14:01.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把那东西拿远点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:01.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get that thing away from me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我起疹子了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's givin' me hives
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.13,0:14:05.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它特别指出了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:05.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It specifically states that
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.97,0:14:09.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所有雇主必须为其员工
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:09.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all employers must provide his or her employees
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.44,0:14:12.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,提供安全清洁的场所以安置私有财产
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:12.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a secure, clean place to store personal property
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.71,0:14:14.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:14.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blast you, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.90,0:14:16.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算你狠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:16.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You drive a hard bargain
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.86,0:14:18.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我大概能给你凑合弄一个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:18.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I could rustle something up for you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.48,0:14:23.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  滋滋冒油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:23.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sizzle those juices
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.02,0:14:28.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:28.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here we go
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.22,0:14:30.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:30.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Found it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.09,0:14:32.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:32.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.46,0:14:35.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我在海军服役时用的储物柜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:35.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me Old Navy locker
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.43,0:14:36.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完好如初
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:36.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good as new
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.26,0:14:38.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是谁  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:38.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who's that, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.20,0:14:41.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好像是斯特林下士  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:41.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That appears to be corporal Sterling, lad
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.90,0:14:43.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那场恶作剧我早忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:43.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I forgot all about that prank
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你的储物柜准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, your locker's ready
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.36,0:14:49.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以像共用发网那样共用储物柜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:49.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do we get to share this locker like we share hairnets?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.29,0:14:51.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想都别想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:51.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not in a whale's age
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.25,0:14:53.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先别急  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:53.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, not so fast, Mr. Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.57,0:14:54.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,法律要求的是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:54.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The law requires that
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.87,0:14:58.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全体员工都要有安置私人物品的场所
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:58.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all employees have a secure place for personal items
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.35,0:15:01.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以法律要求你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.35,0:15:01.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So you are required by law
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.39,0:15:02.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,共用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:02.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to share
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.62,0:15:05.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,勉强共用一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:05.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I suppose I can share
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.36,0:15:07.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,纯粹是法律规定罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:07.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but only since it's required by law
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.16,0:15:09.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这玩意脏死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.16,0:15:09.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This thing is filthy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该不会要我把它弄干净吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't expect me to clean it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.29,0:15:13.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可不会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:13.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, he doesn't
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也不会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I don't either
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.45,0:15:33.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:33.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blimey
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.28,0:15:36.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新兵训练营过后就没这么亮过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:36.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She hasn't sparkled like this since boot camp
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.00,0:15:37.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续干  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:37.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Carry on, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.10,0:15:39.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,的确不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:39.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Impressive indeed
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,管好你的小脏手  只准碰你那半柜子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just keep your grubby little hands to your side
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got it, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.43,0:15:46.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于能有个干净的地方来放牙刷了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.43,0:15:46.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally I have a clean place to store my toothbrush
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要碰我的竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just don't touch my clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.80,0:15:50.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,保证不会发生意外
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:50.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I promise nothing untoward will happen
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.77,0:15:54.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.77,0:15:54.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up, Spongebob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  干什么啊你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.51,0:15:59.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你应该在煎肉饼才对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.51,0:15:59.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be fry cooking
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.18,0:16:02.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都说了不要碰我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:02.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you not to touch my stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.00,0:16:02.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没碰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:02.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.66,0:16:04.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我戴了防护手套
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:04.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wore protective gloves
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.49,0:16:07.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再说你不觉得它现在多有格调吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.49,0:16:07.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And besides, don't you like how classy it looks now?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.44,0:16:08.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,丝绒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:08.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Velvet?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然我很想陪你闲聊的  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, I'd like to stand by and idly chat with you, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我必须要干蟹堡王的活了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I must attend to my krusty krab duties
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以后啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In the future
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.03,0:16:15.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请你尽量少来打扰  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.03,0:16:14.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,please keep your interruptions
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.11,0:16:15.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to a minimum, sir, please
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.08,0:16:20.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找你的零钱  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:20.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And here is your change, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.19,0:16:26.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个傻子在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:26.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that idiot doing now?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.84,0:16:29.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有零钱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:29.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Loose change
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.35,0:16:40.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望你不是要把那堆箱子挤储物柜里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:37.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not trying
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:40.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to shove those boxes into that locker
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.01,0:16:40.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太晩了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:40.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too late
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.54,0:16:41.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,已经挤进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:41.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's already done
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.30,0:16:42.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是你弄坏了我的竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.30,0:16:42.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you smashed my clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.59,0:16:43.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海神保佑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:43.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so help me, Neptune
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.46,0:16:43.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:43.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will--
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.89,0:16:44.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:44.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.97,0:16:46.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,空间多得很
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.97,0:16:46.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of room
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.43,0:16:49.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我扩建了一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.43,0:16:49.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I expanded a bit
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.98,0:16:52.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好是好  可我的竖笛在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:52.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it's all fine and dandy, but where's my clarinet?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.43,0:16:53.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简单
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:53.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's simple
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.55,0:16:56.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要查一下卡片索引就能找到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:56.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just simply consult the card catalog and find
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.65,0:16:57.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥的竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:57.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.86,0:16:59.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抽屉36.8-B
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:59.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,drawer 36.8-b
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.24,0:17:02.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看见没
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.24,0:17:02.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.19,0:17:02.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:02.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.90,0:17:03.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是要记住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:03.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but remember
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.54,0:17:06.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,竖笛必须得没事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:06.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it is vitally important that nothing happens to it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No worries, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.06,0:17:09.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:09.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're in good hands
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.02,0:17:11.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:11.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eat up
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.39,0:17:14.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:14.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以点餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,May I order, please?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.36,0:17:19.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好的  你要点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:19.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, what do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.66,0:17:21.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:21.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.00,0:17:24.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,后边没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:24.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,everything okay back there?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.27,0:17:27.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  就是在搞点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.27,0:17:27.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just a bit of, um
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,整修
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,renovation
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.51,0:17:33.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:33.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.01,0:17:34.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:34.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.92,0:17:35.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:35.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sponge--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.74,0:17:36.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:36.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.04,0:17:39.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到了  36.8-B
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:39.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There, 36.8-b
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.53,0:17:40.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有张字条
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.53,0:17:40.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A note?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.85,0:17:43.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,整修期间  物品已临时转移
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:42.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Item has been temporarily moved
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.73,0:17:43.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,during reconstruction
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.35,0:17:48.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请到1018.2-E架
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:48.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Relocated to shelf 1,018.2-e"
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.45,0:17:49.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:49.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.56,0:17:53.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,1018.2-E
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:53.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,1,018.2-e
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.89,0:17:54.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又是字条
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:54.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another note?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.06,0:18:00.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说过1018.2-E了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.06,0:18:00.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Did I say 1,018.2-e?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.15,0:18:04.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说2019.3-F
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:04.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"I meant 2,019.3-f
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.92,0:18:05.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:05.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry"
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.79,0:18:07.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:07.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.01,0:18:08.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.01,0:18:08.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.44,0:18:10.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝别走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:10.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.78,0:18:13.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你把我竖笛怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:13.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What have you done with my--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.71,0:18:26.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我没在闹着玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:26.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob, I do not play games
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.73,0:18:30.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:30.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.03,0:18:33.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么地方啊这是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:33.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.21,0:18:36.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:36.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.82,0:18:37.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.82,0:18:37.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.91,0:18:41.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:41.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come back
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.61,0:18:42.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要我的竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.61,0:18:42.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need my clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.60,0:18:43.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:43.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come back
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.56,0:18:44.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.56,0:18:44.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.78,0:18:45.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:45.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.05,0:18:50.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是这片竖笛丛林的守护者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:50.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am the keeper of the horned forest
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请表明你的来意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,State your business here
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.56,0:18:54.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:54.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.05,0:18:56.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是来找我的竖笛的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:56.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to find my clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.47,0:18:58.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,竖笛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:18:58.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,clarinet?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.31,0:19:00.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  我的竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.31,0:19:00.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, my clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.11,0:19:02.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是它引以为傲的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.11,0:19:02.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of which I am the proud owner
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.07,0:19:10.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,竖笛是没有主人的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:10.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A clarinet is not owned
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.45,0:19:13.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你为何不告诉我你真正的来意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:13.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me why you're really here?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.77,0:19:14.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说我骗你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:14.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You callin' me a liar?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.14,0:19:18.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你的语气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:18.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate your tone
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我无意冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to offend you
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.41,0:19:27.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这片圣地庇护竖笛不受迫害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:24.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is a sacred place
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.03,0:19:27.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where clarinets can live without persecution
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.44,0:19:30.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你需要学会尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:30.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You need to learn respect
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.70,0:19:32.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经学会了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:32.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've learned
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.79,0:19:35.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经学会尊重了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:35.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've learned respect
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.45,0:19:36.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.45,0:19:36.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.42,0:19:48.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你个白痴给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:48.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stand still, you idiot
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.04,0:19:53.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逮着你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:53.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got you now
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.16,0:19:58.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:19:58.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the--
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.02,0:19:59.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:19:59.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.09,0:20:00.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:00.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spongebob?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:29.97,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(346.964,521.911)}你赢了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.97,0:20:31.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:31.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I win
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.39,0:20:35.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:35.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.31,0:20:38.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,告诉我这到底是什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:36.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.37,0:20:38.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what in the wide world of sports is this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.23,0:20:40.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是怎么变这么大的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.23,0:20:40.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And how did you get so big?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.53,0:20:43.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定是因为压力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:43.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must be all the pressure
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It must be
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.47,0:20:48.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,压力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:48.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The pressure
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got to get out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.21,0:20:53.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要到哪去  你个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:53.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, you imbecile?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.06,0:21:12.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就快逮到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:12.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Almost got you
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.30,0:21:26.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚哄了个老太太花二十块买蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:23.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just sweet-talked an old lady
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:26.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out of 20 bucks for a krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.52,0:21:37.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:37.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Such a nightmare
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.69,0:21:40.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥你要说什么啊  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:40.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, what are you trying to say, buddy?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.02,0:21:44.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚进去那里面拿竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.02,0:21:44.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I tried to get my clarinet in there
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.44,0:21:45.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:45.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's impossible
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.24,0:21:45.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:45.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Clarin--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:48.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:48.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean this
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.06,0:21:49.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪里搞来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:49.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.82,0:21:52.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你为了它大惊小怪闹腾成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:52.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, with all the ruckus you were making over it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.20,0:21:54.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我就自己保管  保证安全
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:54.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I kept it with me just to make sure it was safe
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.12,0:21:57.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就当是朋友的一点心意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:21:57.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Call it a friendly gesture
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.79,0:22:00.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就让你看看什么叫朋友的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:00.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a friendly gesture
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.32,0:22:03.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知不知道我受了多少恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:03.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you know the horror I've endured?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.31,0:22:07.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看你作何感想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.31,0:22:07.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you like it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.81,0:22:16.74,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(752.09,598.336)}市中心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.10,0:22:18.10,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(752.09,598.336)}远了去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:24.73,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(667.856,469.622)}今日竖笛试演
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.03,0:22:27.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥先生  准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:27.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Mr. Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.15,0:22:29.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.15,0:22:29.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I am
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.85,0:22:31.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.85,0:22:31.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.08,0:22:34.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说来荒唐  我来这可是历经
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:34.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't believe what I had to go through to get--
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.97,0:22:35.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.97,0:22:35.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.76,0:22:38.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说来荒唐  我来这可是历经千辛万苦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.76,0:22:38.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe what I had to go through to get here
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.92,0:22:45.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是要把竖笛给他送过来而已
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:45.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was just going to bring him his clarinet
